{"title":"Career Roadmap · Energy Analyst","role":"Energy Analyst","summary":"An Energy Analyst studies energy consumption, generation, costs, efficiency, markets, and environmental performance to help organizations make better energy decisions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc in Renewable Energy Science, this is a strong career alignment. The graduate should combine renewable-energy technology, energy systems, statistics, data analysis, energy economics, forecasting, and sustainability."},{"type":"p","text":"The role can cover different areas—energy efficiency, renewable-energy analytics, electricity markets, solar/wind performance, energy forecasting, corporate energy management, or sustainability—so specialization during the degree is useful."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Typical Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc"},{"text":"Renewable energy + energy systems + analytics"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"Energy Analyst / Renewable Energy Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Experienced"},{"text":"Senior Energy Analyst / Energy Consultant / Energy Market Analyst"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Energy Manager / Energy Strategy Lead / Renewable Energy Analytics Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills to Build","Proof of Progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Energy & science foundation"},{"text":"Physics, mathematics, chemistry, electricity"},{"text":"Basic energy analysis project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Renewable technologies"},{"text":"Solar, wind, storage, grid fundamentals"},{"text":"Renewable-energy project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Energy analytics"},{"text":"Excel, Python, statistics, forecasting"},{"